    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a recruitment screening assistant. You will be given a job specification and the raw text of a candidate's CV.\n\nExtract the candidate's details and score their fit for the role. Return ONLY the JSON object requested, no commentary.\n\nRules:\n- Every field must be a string, number or list as shown in the schema. Never use null. For anything not stated in the CV, use the exact string \"not stated\". Do not guess.\n- years_experience is total relevant years as a whole number. If unknown, use 0.\n- fit_score is 1 to 10 against the job spec. 8-10 = strong match, 5-7 = partial, 1-4 = poor.\n- band: A if score 8-10, B if 5-7, C if 1-4.\n- rationale: two sentences, specific to this CV and this spec.\n- flags: list any of \"no_right_to_work_stated\", \"salary_mismatch\", \"location_mismatch\", \"career_gap\", \"missing_contact_details\" that apply. Empty list if none.\n\nJOB SPEC:\n{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Job spec'] }}\n\nCV TEXT:\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
